flowchart TD
  A[Create disposable Postgres 16 container] --> B[Validate DNS, TCP, auth, SELECT 1]
  B --> C[npm ci in Linux container]
  C --> D[npx prisma validate]
  D --> E[npx prisma generate]
  E --> F[npx prisma migrate deploy]
  F --> G[npx prisma migrate status]
  G --> H[Catalog checks for critical tables]
  H --> I[Run Prisma-backed integration suites]
  I --> J[Run InMemory companion suites]
  J --> K[Run backend test suite]
  K --> L[Run backend build]
  L --> M[Run root build]
  M --> N[Remove disposable container]

  I --> P1[EDP persistence Prisma PASS]
  I --> P2[Simulation runtime evidence HTTP PASS]
  I --> P3[Simulation runtime evidence persistence Prisma PASS]
  I --> P4[EDP runtime E2E FAIL: timeout-sensitive]

  J --> M1[edp.persistence.memory PASS]
  J --> M2[edp.runtime.memory PASS]
  J --> M3[simulation-runtime-evidence.memory PASS]
